  "paths": {
    "/apis/v1/tweakers-net/products/product": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Comparing Dutch shop prices, shipping costs and delivery times for one product found with search or pasted as a tweakers.net/pricewatch URL.",
        "operationId": "tweakers-net.products.product",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "properties": {
                  "product_id": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Pricewatch product id, the number in https://tweakers.net/pricewatch/{id}/...\n\nProvider reference: minimum 1."
                  },
                  "url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "A tweakers.net Pricewatch product URL. Pattern: ^https?://(?:www\\.)?tweakers\\.net/pricewatch/[0-9]+(?:[/?#]|$)."
                  }
                },
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "properties": {
                          "product_id": {}
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "product_id"
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "properties": {
                          "url": {}
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "url"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "provider": {
                  "summary": "Official provider example; checked against AIsa request constraints",
                  "value": {
                    "product_id": 1978140
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Read one Tweakers Pricewatch product by product id or URL: name, brand, category breadcrumb, spec summary and key specs, EAN/SKU codes, images, user rating, lowest and highest price in EUR, and every shop offer listed on the page with shop name, price, shipping cost, total price and delivery/stock indication, including refurbished offers (flagged).\n\nThe response contains the tool result directly.\n\n| Documented field | Provider type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `brand` | string |  |\n| `breadcrumb` | string[] |  |\n| `category` | string | Top Pricewatch category from the breadcrumb, e.g. 'Smartphones'. |\n| `country` | string |  |\n| `currency` | string |  |\n| `eans` | string[] |  |\n| `highest_price` | number |  |\n| `images` | string[] |  |\n| `lowest_price` | number | Lowest current price of a new item over all shops, EUR; null when no shop lists it. |\n| `name` | string |  |\n| `observed_at_ms` | number |  |\n| `offers` | object[] | Every offer on the page: new offers first (cheapest first, as Tweakers sorts them), then refurbished and returned items. |\n| `product_id` | number |  |\n| `rating` | number |  |\n| `refurbished_count` | number |  |\n| `review_count` | number |  |\n| `shop_count` | number | Number of new-item offers listed. |\n| `skus` | string[] |  |\n| `specs` | object[] | Key specifications ('Belangrijkste specificaties'). |\n| `specs_summary` | string | Short spec line, e.g. '6,1\" • 2556x1179 • 128GB'; null on pages without the schema.org Product block (products without current prices). |\n| `url` | string |  |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so.",
